  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance to Government to support policy reforms for DPC2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Task Description The task is the provision of two senior advisors to the Ministry of Finance and the Governor of the Central Bank of Mongolia, respectively.  Development Objective of the Project To assist the government in designing, implementing and monitoring the policy reforms to be undertaken under the planned Second Development Policy Credit. Comments on grant approval process Comments on process of mobilizing trust funds and grants This is a grant financed by the Korea Trust Fund. Comments on Financing Plan The financing has been obtained from the Korea Trust Fund.</narrative>
  </description>
